title: "Galaxy Tools for Metabolomics"
abstract: >-
  Galaxy tools, data managers and workflows for metabolomics and related fields, maintained
  by the Computational Metabolomics Research Group, with testing, an automatically
  generated catalogue and publishing of reference data on Hugging Face.
type: software
authors:
